[ledge] This 7.18 mm²,4.3 by 3.1 mm root/radial-joint underside is 10 degrees off facing the bed. It is externally reachable with H alone and belongs to the separately Tree-supported carrier; it does not alter the exposed source neck skin or source R6 exterior support-free band. Physical cleanup and handling capacity remain unmeasured.
alternatives: A larger local elbow pad increases the small underside with more stock and needs the nearby sample-clearance route reviewed. A smoother blended/tapered joint changes its print-down face but also its boundary near the source slot. A solid broad root replaces the local joint with more material and reduced access.
